Breaks: clean-my-ubuntu (<< 2.0.0~)
Replaces: clean-my-ubuntu (<< 2.0.0~)
Description: free up disk space and keep Ubuntu tidy
 CleanMate finds caches, old logs, leftovers from removed packages,
 developer and AI tool caches, and more, and removes them safely after you
 have reviewed the list.
 .
 It comes as a desktop app (GTK 4) and a terminal app (cm) that share one
 engine. System items use the standard password dialog; everything else runs
 as you.

Package: clean-my-ubuntu
Architecture: all
Section: oldlibs
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, cleanmate (= ${binary:Version})
Description: transitional package for CleanMate
 Clean My Ubuntu is now called CleanMate. This package moves existing
 installs over and keeps the old clean-my-ubuntu and cmu commands working;
 it can be removed safely.
